<para>Safe to call from ISR context. The increment runs inside a critical section: <computeroutput>count++</computeroutput> on a volatile int16_t is a load-modify-store, and a preempting ISR signaling the same semaphore would otherwise be overwritten by the stale store (lost signal).</para>
